-  return `# L2G Builder/Merger Rolling Release Roadmap\n\nUpdated: ${nowIso()}\nCurrent release: L2G-BM v3.8\n\nThis roadmap is maintained with every Builder/Merger release. It is directional and may be reordered when compatibility or workbook-integrity issues require a targeted synchronization release.\n\n## Current release\n\n### v3.8 — Exception Resolution Ledger and Governance Pack\n- Persistent per-exception resolution choices and operator notes.\n- Import/export of l2g_builder_decision_plan_v1.json.\n- Optional unresolved-decision execution gate.\n- Build and Merge governance ZIP packs.\n- Embedded rolling roadmap.\n\n## Next 10 releases\n\n${V38_ROADMAP.map((r,i)=>`${i+1}. **${r.version} — ${r.title}**\n   - ${r.summary}`).join('\n')}\n\n## Standing guardrails\n\n- L2G Builder/Merger remains local/offline and client-data safe.\n- Stable package kinds remain backward compatible unless a coordinated contract release explicitly changes them.\n- Workshop draft data does not create Met, Not Met, evidence-sufficiency, assessment-ready, score, or final CMMC conclusions.\n- Reviewer-authored workbook content wins by default when conflicts exist.\n- Formula, validation, formatting, hidden-sheet, and source-lineage preservation remain release gates.\n`;
+  return `# L2G Builder/Merger Rolling Release Roadmap
+
+Updated: ${nowIso()}
+Current release: L2G-BM v3.10
+
+This roadmap is maintained with every Builder/Merger release. v3.9 remains reserved and was not consumed by the targeted RG-4 synchronization release.
+
+## Current release
+
+### v3.10 — RG-4 SSP Final Word-QA Sidecar Producer
+- Exact local DOCX hashing and Open XML inspection.
+- Embedded SSP Word-export manifest extraction and reconciliation.
+- Frozen four automated checks plus one required local human layout review.
+- Deterministic lineage, sidecar ID, and package fingerprint derivation.
+- qa_complete, qa_incomplete, and qa_blocked contract states.
+- Existing Workbook Build, Workbook Merge, decision-plan, and External CSV routes preserved.
+
+## Next 10 releases
+
+${V38_ROADMAP.map((r,i)=>`${i+1}. **${r.version} — ${r.title}**
+   - ${r.summary}`).join('\n')}
+
+## Standing guardrails
+
+- L2G Builder/Merger remains local/offline and client-data safe.
+- The SSP Word-QA sidecar is evidence only and does not determine source currency, readiness, compliance, assessment, certification, scoring, evidence sufficiency, technical accuracy, or client-release approval.
+- Stable package kinds remain backward compatible unless a coordinated contract release explicitly changes them.
+- Reviewer-authored workbook content wins by default when conflicts exist.
+- Formula, validation, formatting, hidden-sheet, and source-lineage preservation remain release gates.
+`;
